<DocsLayout title="Kubernetes">
  <h1>Kubernetes</h1>
  <p>
    Deploy one service instance per product or environment. Keep Redis isolated
    unless the owning product intentionally shares a quota namespace.
  </p>

  <h2>Network boundary</h2>
  <p>
    Expose the gRPC port only to trusted callers through NetworkPolicy,
    service mesh policy, private load balancers, or equivalent controls.
  </p>

  <h2>TLS and mTLS</h2>
  <p>
    TLS and mTLS are transport security features only. They do not replace
    product authorization, entitlement checks, or business policy decisions.
  </p>

  <h2>Redis</h2>
  <p>
    Use Redis single-primary or primary-replica topology. Redis Cluster is out
    of scope for v1.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>

